sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor L as Learner
actor A1 as Admin reviewer
actor A2 as Second admin
participant API as FastAPI /admin
participant DB as PostgreSQL
participant AI as AI1 + AI2
L->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/review-request (7-day window)
API->>DB: review_request REQUESTED (base=V1)
A1->>API: POST /review-requests/{id}/claim
API->>DB: IN_REVIEW + 30-min lease
A1->>API: POST /deviations (reason, score)
alt change > 30% of max
  API->>A2: confirmation request
  A2->>API: POST /deviations/{id}/confirm
end
A1->>API: POST /review-requests/{id}/decision APPROVE
API->>DB: V2 APPROVED_PENDING_ANALYSIS
API->>AI: run AI1 -> AI2 for v2 scope
alt analysis valid
  AI-->>API: validated analysis
  API->>DB: V2 OFFICIAL, current_result_version_id=V2
else analysis failed
  API->>DB: ANALYSIS_FAILED, V1 remains official
end
